The PR introduces a critical bug: `page_count` now uses floor division, dropping the final partial page and causing missing order rows during export. Fix the page count logic to use `math.ceil` (or equivalent) before merging.

```json
{
  "pr": "evals/pr/01-pagination.diff",
  "verdict": "request_changes",
  "issues": [
    {
      "file": "app/pagination.py",
      "severity": "high",
      "issue": "page_count uses floor division, omitting the last partial page",
      "suggestion": "Use math.ceil(total_items / page_size) or add a check for remainder"
    }
  ]
}
```
